# Google Gemini API key — used ONLY by the backend (POST /api/ocr/analyze)
# for medical document analysis. The frontend NEVER reads this key.
# Get a key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# Never commit the real key. Paste it into backend/.env locally and set it
# as an environment variable on your hosting provider.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional: Gemini model used by the medical document analysis.
# Defaults to gemini-2.5-flash when not set (with fallbacks to 2.0-flash,
# then 1.5-flash).
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash